1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,400
We are the victims here.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:09,680
We are being victimized by a very greedy entity.

3
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:17,380
I am shocked by the way the people that we have been in business with are treating us.

4
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:25,520
I cannot believe it, quite frankly, how far apart we are on so many things.

5
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:30,940
How they plead poverty, that they are losing money left and right when giving hundreds

6
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:34,640
of millions of dollars to their CEOs.

7
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:44,960
The entire business model has been changed by streaming, digital, AI.

8
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:50,260
This is a moment of history that is a moment of truth.

9
00:00:50,260 --> 00:00:56,020
If we don't stand tall right now, we are all going to be in trouble.

10
00:00:56,020 --> 00:01:01,320
We are all going to be in jeopardy of being replaced by machines.

11
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:09,760
You cannot change the business model as much as it has changed and not expect the contract

12
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:10,760
to change too.

13
00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:18,600
We are not going to keep doing incremental changes on a contract that no longer honors what is

14
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:24,060
happening right now with this business model that was foisted upon us.

15
00:01:24,060 --> 00:01:28,980
What are we doing, moving around furniture on the Titanic?

16
00:01:28,980 --> 00:01:29,980
It's crazy.

